  <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="wrapperLayout">
   <item>
    <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="topVBoxLayout">
     <item>
      <layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="horizontalLayout">
       <item>
        <widget class="QGroupBox" name="groupBox">
         <property name="title">
          <string>Luma</string>
         </property>
         <layout class="QGridLayout" name="gridLayout_2" columnstretch="0,1">
          <item row="1" column="1">
           <widget class="QSpinBox" name="lumaOffsetSpinBox">
            <property name="toolTip">
             <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Use a scale, an offset and (optionally) inversion to transform the luma YUV values before transformation to RGB. The value difference to &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;offset&lt;/span&gt; is scaled by &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;scale&lt;/span&gt; relative to &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;offset&lt;/span&gt;. The used equation is:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Y&lt;span style=&quot; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;Out&lt;/span&gt; = inv*(Y&lt;span style=&quot; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;In&lt;/span&gt;-offset) * scale + offset&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;inv&lt;/span&gt; is -1 if inversion is activated and 1 if not.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item row="1" column="0">
           <widget class="QLabel" name="label_6">
            <property name="toolTip">
             <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Use a scale, an offset and (optionally) inversion to transform the luma YUV values before transformation to RGB. The value difference to &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;offset&lt;/span&gt; is scaled by &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;scale&lt;/span&gt; relative to &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;offset&lt;/span&gt;. The used equation is:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Y&lt;span style=&quot; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;Out&lt;/span&gt; = inv*(Y&lt;span style=&quot; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;In&lt;/span&gt;-offset) * scale + offset&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;inv&lt;/span&gt; is -1 if inversion is activated and 1 if not.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
            </property>
            <property name="text">
             <string>Offset</string>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item row="0" column="1">
           <widget class="QSpinBox" name="lumaScaleSpinBox">
            <property name="toolTip">
             <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Use a scale, an offset and (optionally) inversion to transform the luma YUV values before transformation to RGB. The value difference to &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;offset&lt;/span&gt; is scaled by &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;scale&lt;/span&gt; relative to &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;offset&lt;/span&gt;. The used equation is:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Y&lt;span style=&quot; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;Out&lt;/span&gt; = inv*(Y&lt;span style=&quot; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;In&lt;/span&gt;-offset) * scale + offset&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;inv&lt;/span&gt; is -1 if inversion is activated and 1 if not.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item row="0" column="0">
           <widget class="QLabel" name="label_4">
            <property name="toolTip">
             <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Use a scale, an offset and (optionally) inversion to transform the luma YUV values before transformation to RGB. The value difference to &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;offset&lt;/span&gt; is scaled by &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;scale&lt;/span&gt; relative to &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;offset&lt;/span&gt;. The used equation is:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Y&lt;span style=&quot; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;Out&lt;/span&gt; = inv*(Y&lt;span style=&quot; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;In&lt;/span&gt;-offset) * scale + offset&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;inv&lt;/span&gt; is -1 if inversion is activated and 1 if not.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
            </property>
            <property name="text">
             <string>Scale</string>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item row="2" column="0" colspan="2">
           <widget class="QCheckBox" name="lumaInvertCheckBox">
            <property name="toolTip">
             <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Use a scale, an offset and (optionally) inversion to transform the luma YUV values before transformation to RGB. The value difference to &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;offset&lt;/span&gt; is scaled by &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;scale&lt;/span&gt; relative to &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;offset&lt;/span&gt;. The used equation is:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Y&lt;span style=&quot; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;Out&lt;/span&gt; = inv*(Y&lt;span style=&quot; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;In&lt;/span&gt;-offset) * scale + offset&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;inv&lt;/span&gt; is -1 if inversion is activated and 1 if not.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
            </property>
            <property name="text">
             <string>Invert</string>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
         </layout>
        </widget>
       </item>
