          <item row="1" column="0">
           <widget class="QLabel" name="label_7">
            <property name="toolTip">
             <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Use a scale, an offset and (optionally) inversion to transform the chroma YUV values before transformation to RGB. The value difference to &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;offset&lt;/span&gt; is scaled by &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;scale&lt;/span&gt; relative to &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;offset&lt;/span&gt;. The used equation is:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;C&lt;span style=&quot; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;Out&lt;/span&gt; = inv*(C&lt;span style=&quot; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;In&lt;/span&gt;-offset) * scale + offset&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;inv&lt;/span&gt; is -1 if inversion is activated and 1 if not.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
